   "source": [
    "# Week 2: ML Task Framing — Content Refresh Opportunity Scoring\n",
    "\n",
    "## 1. My Lane as an ML Task\n",
    "* **Task Type:** Continuous Regression / Opportunity Scoring Engine\n",
    "* **Core Objective:** Predict future organic performance decay to rank content items that need immediate content refreshes."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 2. Target or Proxy Column\n",
    "* **Target Variable ($y$):** `click_delta` (Continuous float value representing change in average organic clicks: $\\text{Clicks}_{\\text{recent}} - \\text{Clicks}_{\\text{baseline}}$).\n",
    "* **Proxy Meaning:** Negative deltas signal content decay and loss of visibility; positive deltas indicate growing or stable content trajectory."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 3. Success Metric\n",
    "* **Primary Metric:** Mean Absolute Error (MAE) evaluated against a Zero-Change Baseline ($y_{\\text{pred}} = 0$).\n",
    "* **Secondary Metric:** Coefficient of Determination ($R^2$) to evaluate variance capture."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 4. Unit of Analysis as a Real Dataframe\n",
    "* **Unit of Analysis:** **One Row = One Content Item (`content_hash_id`) aggregated over temporal windows.**"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import duckdb\n",
    "import pandas as pd\n",
    "\n",
    "# Connect to DuckDB and query Hugging Face starter dataset\n",
    "con = duckdb.connect()\n",
    "con.execute(\"INSTALL httpfs; LOAD httpfs;\")\n",
    "REL = 'hf://datasets/FlyRank/internship-warehouse'\n",
    "\n",
    "query = f\"\"\"\n",
    "WITH recent_perf AS (\n",
    "    SELECT \n",
    "        content_hash_id,\
    "        AVG(COALESCE(gsc_impressions, 0)) AS avg_imp_recent,\
    "        AVG(COALESCE(gsc_clicks, 0)) AS avg_clicks_recent,\
    "        AVG(COALESCE(gsc_avg_position, 0)) AS avg_pos_recent\n",
    "    FROM read_parquet('{REL}/fact_content_daily_performance_sample.parquet')\n",
    "    WHERE report_date >= '2026-06-01'\n",
    "    GROUP BY content_hash_id\n",
    "),\n",
    "baseline_perf AS (\n",
    "    SELECT \n",
    "        content_hash_id,\
    "        AVG(COALESCE(gsc_impressions, 0)) AS avg_imp_base,\
    "        AVG(COALESCE(gsc_clicks, 0)) AS avg_clicks_base,\
    "        AVG(COALESCE(gsc_avg_position, 0)) AS avg_pos_base\n",
    "    FROM read_parquet('{REL}/fact_content_daily_performance_sample.parquet')\n",
    "    WHERE report_date < '2026-06-01'\n",
    "    GROUP BY content_hash_id\n",
    ")\n",
    "SELECT \n",
    "    r.content_hash_id,\
    "    r.avg_imp_recent,\
    "    r.avg_clicks_recent,\
    "    r.avg_pos_recent,\
    "    b.avg_imp_base,\
    "    b.avg_clicks_base,\
    "    b.avg_pos_base,\
    "    (r.avg_clicks_recent - b.avg_clicks_base) AS click_delta\n",
    "FROM recent_perf r\n",
    "JOIN baseline_perf b ON r.content_hash_id = b.content_hash_id\n",
    "LIMIT 5;\n",
    "\"\"\"\n",
    "\n",
    "df_sample = con.sql(query).df()\n",
    "print(\"Unit of Analysis DataFrame Preview (1 row = 1 content_hash_id):\")\n",
    "display(df_sample)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 5. Why ML Beats a Fixed Rule Here\n",
    "* **Non-Linear Interactions:** Fixed heuristics (e.g., \"Flag any article older than 180 days\") fail because high-authority evergreen content does not decay at a fixed calendar rate.\n",
    "* **Multi-Variable Trajectory:** Machine learning models evaluate non-linear feature combinations—such as stable impression volume paired with falling click-through rates and subtle position drops—to flag decay *before* catastrophic traffic loss occurs.\n",
    "* **Actionable Output:** Drives an automated priority queue for editorial teams, identifying which articles need immediate search intent alignment, structural updating, or pruning."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
